          <change when="2024-12-08T19:07:26-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/ngonis">Finalized - done</change>
          <change when="2024-12-08T19:07:01-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/ngonis">Commit - Several accents and entry errors corrected.</change>
          <change when="2024-12-08T18:50:19-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/ngonis">Vote - AcceptText - We move on.</change>
          <change when="2024-12-05T03:26:11-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/RiccardoVecchiato">Vote - AcceptText - Now that the sigma has been underdotted, considering the round traces visible after the ny, and the following adjective, this seems to be a plausible suggestion.</change>
          <change when="2024-01-13T20:05:12-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/costasbala">Submit - Resubmitting with explanation for κιβωτός.</change>
          <change when="2024-01-13T20:04:45-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/costasbala">Commit - Perhaps, I was overconfident with the sigma in l. 19 κιβω[τ]ὸς̣ (now I've dotted it), which I saw as having a more round form, not exactly paralleled but cf. κύαθος χαλκοῦς l. 37. In κύαθος, the sigma's horizontal stroke doesn't seem to be abraded (no ink traces even after processing with software). It would be good if someone checked it in Berlin. Nevertheless, I think a nu is much more difficult and κιβωτὸς is the obvious option with the fem. adj.  </change>
          <change when="2024-01-13T14:10:17-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/dkaltsas">Vote - Return-Straight-to-Sender - Please provide a parallel for the form of the sigma in κιβωτός in l. 19. </change>
          <change when="2024-01-10T22:21:34-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/costasbala">Submit - Corrections + BL 13 integration</change>
          <change when="2024-01-10T22:20:35-05:00" who="http://papyri.info/editor/users/costasbala">Commit - In l. 5 κλ{ε}ίναι (l. κλίναι) =&gt; κλεῖναι (l. κλῖναι). L. 19 κιβώ[τι]ον ξυλίνηι (l. ξύλινον) =&gt; κιβω[τ]ὸς ξυλίνηι (l. ξυλίνη). L. 35 ἐν ἱματιοφοριν δερματίνῃ =&gt; ἐν ἱματιοφορίδι δερματίν\ῃ/</change>
          <change when="2022-01-10T03:14:37-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/mgerhardt">Finalized - Ready.</change>
          <change when="2022-01-10T03:09:38-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/mgerhardt">Vote - Accept-Straight-to-Finalization - Fine.</change>
          <change when="2022-01-10T03:08:59-05:00" who="https://papyri.info/editor/users/mgerhardt">Submit - Lin13: (ὐπαγκ|^ώ^|(νιον)) --&gt; (ὑπαγκ|^ώ^|(νιον)) (typo)</change>
